<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Channels on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/tags/channels/</link><description>Recent content in Channels on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi-VN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://quydmfl.github.io/tags/channels/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>02. Channels</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/02-channels/</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/02-channels/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="../01-goroutines/"&gt;Bài 01&lt;/a&gt; tạo ra goroutine — bài này đi vào cách chúng giao tiếp với nhau: channel. &amp;ldquo;Don&amp;rsquo;t communicate by sharing memory; share memory by communicating&amp;rdquo; — triết lý cốt lõi của Go concurrency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="unbuffered-channel-gửi-và-nhận-đồng-bộ-hoá-lẫn-nhau"&gt;Unbuffered channel: gửi và nhận đồng bộ hoá lẫn nhau&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; make(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;chan&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;go&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;goroutine: chuẩn bị gửi&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Sleep&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;300&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Millisecond&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;xong việc&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;goroutine: đã gửi xong&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;main: gọi &amp;lt;-ch, sẽ BLOCK&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;msg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ch&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;main: nhận được:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;msg&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;06:14:27.711 main: gọi &amp;lt;-ch, sẽ BLOCK cho tới khi có người gửi
06:14:27.711 goroutine: chuẩn bị gửi
06:14:28.012 goroutine: đã gửi xong
06:14:28.012 main: nhận được: xong việc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Timestamp &lt;code&gt;28.012&lt;/code&gt; xuất hiện đồng thời ở cả 2 dòng cuối&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; nhận được đúng ngay khoảnh khắc goroutine gửi xong, không sớm hơn, không muộn hơn. Đây chính là bản chất unbuffered channel: gửi (&lt;code&gt;ch &amp;lt;- v&lt;/code&gt;) &lt;strong&gt;block cho tới khi có người nhận&lt;/strong&gt;, và ngược lại — cơ chế đồng bộ hoá tự nhiên, không cần thêm &lt;code&gt;sync.Mutex&lt;/code&gt; cho nhiều trường hợp.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>06. Channel internals</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/runtime-internals/06-channel-internals/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/runtime-internals/06-channel-internals/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="../../concurrency/02-channels/"&gt;Concurrency bài 02&lt;/a&gt; và &lt;a href="../../concurrency/03-select-statement/"&gt;bài 03&lt;/a&gt; dùng channel và &lt;code&gt;select&lt;/code&gt; như công cụ đồng bộ hoá. Bài này mở source code Go thật (&lt;code&gt;runtime/chan.go&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;runtime/select.go&lt;/code&gt;) đứng sau &lt;code&gt;make(chan T)&lt;/code&gt; để hiểu vì sao unbuffered channel đồng bộ hoá &amp;ldquo;đúng khoảnh khắc&amp;rdquo;, và &lt;code&gt;select&lt;/code&gt; chọn case sẵn sàng như thế nào.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="hchan-struct-đứng-sau-mọi-channel"&gt;hchan: struct đứng sau mọi channel&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Đọc thẳng &lt;code&gt;runtime/chan.go&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;hchan&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;qcount&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;uint&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// total data in the queue&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;dataqsiz&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;uint&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// size of the circular queue&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;buf&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;unsafe&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Pointer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// points to an array of dataqsiz elements&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;elemsize&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;uint16&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;closed&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;uint32&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;elemtype&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;_type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// element type&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;sendx&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;uint&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// send index&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;recvx&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;uint&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// receive index&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;recvq&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;waitq&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// list of recv waiters&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;sendq&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;waitq&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// list of send waiters&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;lock&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;mutex&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;buf&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;dataqsiz&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;sendx&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;recvx&lt;/code&gt;: ring buffer tuần hoàn — chỉ thật sự chứa dữ liệu nếu channel có buffer (&lt;code&gt;make(chan T, n)&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;recvq&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;sendq&lt;/code&gt;: 2 hàng đợi kiểu &lt;code&gt;waitq&lt;/code&gt; (danh sách liên kết &lt;code&gt;sudog&lt;/code&gt;) — goroutine đang &lt;strong&gt;block chờ nhận&lt;/strong&gt;/&lt;strong&gt;block chờ gửi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;lock&lt;/code&gt;: 1 &lt;code&gt;Mutex&lt;/code&gt; bảo vệ toàn bộ struct — mọi thao tác gửi/nhận/đóng đều phải giành lock này trước&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="sudog-goroutine-xếp-hàng-trên-channel"&gt;sudog: goroutine &amp;ldquo;xếp hàng&amp;rdquo; trên channel&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;runtime/runtime2.go&lt;/code&gt; định nghĩa &lt;code&gt;sudog&lt;/code&gt; — đại diện cho 1 goroutine đang chờ trên 1 channel (hoặc trong &lt;code&gt;select&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>